                 County Board elections to be held every two years for
                 staggered four-year terms for members"; "a proposed bill
                 calling for a referendum on either an indefinite term for the
                 county manager, subject to removal by the County Board, or on
                 a limited yearly basis with a notice of reappointment to be
                 made at the end of each fiscal year in June or at the
                 beginning of each calendar year in January"; and "Provisions
