  urldate     = {2026-10-01},
  annotation  = {The county's own roll of the County Board, one entry per year from 1932
                 to the current year, each member named with the office held that year and
                 with arrivals and departures dated to the day: ``Resigned 12/14/95'',
                 ``Special Election 1/30/96: Replaced Mary Margaret Whipple'', ``Appointed
                 on 7/15/2023 to fill seat vacated by Katie Cristol''. It records service
                 rather than contests, so it is the only source held here that witnesses a
                 member seated without winning an election. The page carries no date of
                 its own and is revised as the Board changes; the copy in
                 data/raw/arlington_county/ is the page as printed on 1 October 2026.
                 Each decade sits in a collapsed accordion and the server refuses curl,
                 so the copy is printed by headless Chrome, which expands every panel.
                 Five of its entries are wrong, each checked against novack1994 and
                 listed on county-corrections: it carries the county's own spelling
                 ``Lucas H. Bleviins'' at 1957; lists F. Freeland Chew twice at 1941 and
                 Mary Margaret Whipple twice at 1986, leaving out Elizabeth B. Magruder
                 and John G. Milliken; dates Howard Massey's appointment to 10 November
                 1952 where dailysun1952appointees names him among the three appointed
                 that September; and gives John W. Purdy the title Vice-President at
                 1977. It also interleaves notes about the Board's clerk into the member
                 column at 1971, 1982, 1989, 1994 and 2000},
}

